WEBVTT

00:09.259 --> 00:10.260
And who are you?

00:12.804 --> 00:14.097
I've never seen you before.

00:16.641 --> 00:18.143
You've got a lot of guts.

00:26.234 --> 00:28.445
Hey, move it. Go on.

00:28.528 --> 00:29.404
Damn, move.

00:31.281 --> 00:32.657
Hey, Gotak, are you alive?

00:33.450 --> 00:35.577
- I'm dead, dumbass.
- You okay?

00:35.660 --> 00:36.619
Just go.

00:36.703 --> 00:37.662
Go where?

00:38.663 --> 00:42.542
- Go to him, fucking assholes.
- You should be training with the team.

00:42.625 --> 00:44.252
What is all this?

00:45.128 --> 00:47.047
What? Training?

00:47.547 --> 00:51.051
Hey, we can't even compete
in the tournament because of you.

00:51.801 --> 00:53.261
What are you saying, dumbass?

00:53.344 --> 00:56.056
We can't compete
because you got suspended.

00:56.139 --> 00:59.059
You stupid dumbass. Fuck.

00:59.142 --> 01:00.101
Fuck! Really?

01:00.977 --> 01:01.811
Are you sure?

01:04.272 --> 01:05.857
Man, I shouldn't have dyed my hair.

01:06.357 --> 01:08.693
- This won't come out for a while.
- You asshole!

01:10.653 --> 01:13.531
What? Are you that happy to see me?
You too?

01:13.615 --> 01:14.991
- My arm!
- Hey, you too?

01:17.535 --> 01:18.661
Fucking asshole!

01:25.668 --> 01:28.797
I don't care if you act out
and bully other kids,

01:28.880 --> 01:31.716
but no fighting
while wearing the Eunjang uniform.

01:31.800 --> 01:34.803
No fighting, okay?
Repeat after me. No fighting!

01:34.886 --> 01:36.262
No fighting.

01:36.346 --> 01:39.182
That's it! Now beat it. Scram.

01:39.724 --> 01:40.934
Go!

01:41.017 --> 01:42.519
- You started it.
- Let's go. Go on.

01:42.602 --> 01:45.188
- Let's go.
- Hey, you said Hyo-man would win.

01:45.271 --> 01:46.189
I didn't know.

01:46.272 --> 01:47.524
Si-eun, here you go.

01:47.607 --> 01:48.608
Are you okay?

01:50.485 --> 01:51.319
Thanks.

01:53.863 --> 01:54.739
Hey, Si-eun.

01:58.326 --> 01:59.160
I'm sorry.

02:00.453 --> 02:02.914
I think I might have got the wrong idea.

02:05.583 --> 02:06.543
Hey.

02:06.626 --> 02:09.963
You don't sound sincere
when you start with "I think."

02:10.463 --> 02:13.174
I'm sorry! My dear Gotak is very flawed!

02:13.258 --> 02:14.801
- But--
- Let go of me, man, please!

02:14.884 --> 02:16.219
He's not a bad kid!

02:20.306 --> 02:22.016
Si-eun, where are you going?

02:24.269 --> 02:26.563
Oh, I'll see you tomorrow. Bye.

02:27.897 --> 02:29.691
Si-eun, you can't just leave.

02:29.774 --> 02:33.570
Oh wow. Such courtesy
is rarely found at Eunjang.

02:34.320 --> 02:37.073
Hey, dumbass.
Who are you impersonating now?

02:37.157 --> 02:38.533
My dad. Didn't you get it?

02:41.286 --> 02:43.454
Anyway, that timing was crazy.

02:45.248 --> 02:46.124
I mean,

02:47.125 --> 02:48.626
if Hu-min hadn't shown up…

02:51.880 --> 02:55.091
You ruined someone's life.
Don't pretend you're a nice guy.

02:57.218 --> 02:58.928
You fucking hypocrite.

03:06.519 --> 03:07.395
I guess…

03:09.272 --> 03:12.567
you must have felt bad
after Hyun-tak said that weird stuff.

03:13.610 --> 03:17.530
Everyone just likes
to talk behind other people's backs.

03:17.614 --> 03:19.365
Don't worry about the rumor.

03:21.367 --> 03:22.410
It's not a rumor.

03:23.912 --> 03:24.746
What?

03:29.834 --> 03:32.337
That's why I decided never to fight.

03:38.760 --> 03:39.677
Never again.

04:02.450 --> 04:07.622
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

05:02.593 --> 05:05.430
11TH GRADE, CLASS 7
09 - PARK HU-MIN

05:10.310 --> 05:12.895
- Baku!
- Hey there!

05:12.979 --> 05:15.648
Hey, nice to see you! Hello!

05:15.732 --> 05:17.984
Hey, put out that cigarette! You punk.

05:18.067 --> 05:19.277
- Baku!
- Hey there!

05:20.903 --> 05:23.364
How have you been?
I'll see you at the canteen later.

05:23.448 --> 05:25.408
Hey, what's this? You lost weight!

05:26.826 --> 05:27.660
How's it going?

05:36.377 --> 05:37.712
Everyone, freeze!

05:41.007 --> 05:41.841
Baku.

05:43.134 --> 05:45.511
- Leave these kids alone.
- It's Baku.

05:45.595 --> 05:47.388
Is this the World Cup Stadium?

05:48.681 --> 05:50.808
You kick balls outside.
What are you doing?

05:52.435 --> 05:54.937
You're right. We should be outside.

05:55.021 --> 05:56.022
- Right, guys?
- Yeah.

05:56.105 --> 05:57.857
- We should go outside.
- Right.

05:58.608 --> 06:01.235
Okay! Let's all get along, yeah?

06:01.319 --> 06:02.820
Hey, man, isn't that right?

06:02.904 --> 06:03.988
Go to class now.

06:04.072 --> 06:07.033
Hurry back to the classroom.
Get ready for class. Go on.

06:10.620 --> 06:11.496
Baku!

06:17.919 --> 06:20.338
You son of a bitch. Baku!

06:21.255 --> 06:25.301
Ganghak High doesn't play basketball.
What they do is closer to martial arts!

06:25.802 --> 06:28.721
Why do we have to play a practice game
with those assholes?

06:29.347 --> 06:32.934
There are all kinds of teams out there.

06:33.017 --> 06:34.435
A true master

06:34.936 --> 06:36.396
doesn't care who he plays.

06:36.896 --> 06:38.898
If there are all kinds of teams out there,

06:38.981 --> 06:41.025
then we can play a different team.

06:41.109 --> 06:43.820
Let's avoid causing problems.
If someone gets hurt--

06:43.903 --> 06:45.154
You chicken.

06:47.698 --> 06:48.533
You moron.

06:49.450 --> 06:52.203
You scored 99 on the IQ test.
Are you a monkey?

06:53.538 --> 06:55.081
- Or a dolphin?
- I'll kill you.

06:55.164 --> 06:58.126
I just couldn't finish
the test in time, dumbass.

06:58.751 --> 07:00.378
This punk ran out of time!

07:00.461 --> 07:02.713
You ran out of time, did you now?

07:02.797 --> 07:05.341
Only idiots run out of time on an IQ test.

07:05.425 --> 07:07.885
Mr. Gotak. You're all grown up now.

07:07.969 --> 07:09.887
All grown up? I've always been taller.

07:09.971 --> 07:11.431
I'll kill you, you jerk!

07:11.514 --> 07:13.850
- Hey!
- Hey, you're killing him.

07:13.933 --> 07:14.767
Stop it!

07:18.229 --> 07:19.063
What's this?

07:20.857 --> 07:21.941
Are we under attack?

07:25.736 --> 07:27.488
We're wanted in the teachers' office.

07:27.989 --> 07:29.073
You're right.

07:29.157 --> 07:31.576
That did happen at the underpass.

07:32.326 --> 07:34.245
But that's an exaggeration--

07:34.328 --> 07:37.957
Everyone who hangs out
with Choi Hyo-man is absent today.

07:38.458 --> 07:40.293
Don't you think that's strange?

07:41.294 --> 07:43.880
There were some kids who saw the fight.

07:45.047 --> 07:46.174
That's news to me.

07:50.386 --> 07:54.432
- "That's news to see," dumbass.
- That's news to see, idiot.

07:54.515 --> 07:56.601
Man, you really have an IQ of 99.

07:56.684 --> 07:58.519
- How dumb are you?
- Shut it, dumbass.

07:58.603 --> 07:59.729
- Moron.
- Hey, be quiet.

08:00.980 --> 08:01.814
Take it.

08:03.483 --> 08:04.734
YOUTH CULTURAL VOLUNTEERS WANTED

08:04.817 --> 08:06.777
You're going to do some volunteer work.

08:06.861 --> 08:08.362
And you'll still get demerits.

08:08.446 --> 08:10.781
Hey, this isn't fair.

08:11.491 --> 08:13.075
What about Hyo-man and the others?

08:13.576 --> 08:15.036
They started the fight!

08:15.119 --> 08:15.953
Hey!

08:16.871 --> 08:18.623
Does this sound like a debate to you?

08:21.918 --> 08:22.752
You punks.

08:23.461 --> 08:24.504
It's true.

08:27.548 --> 08:30.593
Hyo-man and the others started the fight.
We were just--

08:30.676 --> 08:31.511
Yeon Si-eun.

08:32.011 --> 08:34.055
Did these kids rub off on you?

08:34.931 --> 08:36.974
You punks have got to be kidding me.

08:37.475 --> 08:38.768
We're so sorry, Teach!

08:38.851 --> 08:40.436
We'll work hard volunteering!

08:40.520 --> 08:44.065
I'll keep the basketball team
out of trouble from now on.

08:44.148 --> 08:47.735
Once again, as team captain,
I sincerely apologize!

08:53.950 --> 08:55.451
Damn, volunteer work?

08:56.702 --> 08:57.787
Aren't you pissed?

08:58.329 --> 09:00.289
Is it okay to let Hyo-man off the hook?

09:00.373 --> 09:04.627
When I breathe the air in that office,
I get dizzy. I almost threw up.

09:04.710 --> 09:07.338
And you did get in a fight.
What did I say about fighting?

09:07.421 --> 09:11.008
Those punks started it, Baku. Damn.

09:11.092 --> 09:12.093
Hey, friend.

09:16.639 --> 09:17.765
Tell him, Gotak.

09:18.349 --> 09:19.267
Right now?

09:19.350 --> 09:20.851
You should say something.

09:20.935 --> 09:24.272
He sided with you
in the teachers' office, right?

09:28.568 --> 09:29.402
Well,

09:30.861 --> 09:31.696
I'm sorry

09:32.738 --> 09:33.781
about yesterday.

09:35.408 --> 09:38.160
For saying weird stuff and getting angry.

09:38.661 --> 09:39.537
I'm sorry too.

09:40.997 --> 09:41.831
What?

09:42.832 --> 09:43.666
For yesterday.

09:44.208 --> 09:45.459
I'm also sorry.

09:48.504 --> 09:49.380
What's this?

09:50.172 --> 09:53.175
It feels like you've made up,
but then again, not really.

09:53.259 --> 09:54.093
Hey.

09:54.969 --> 09:56.262
I'm not on your team.

09:59.265 --> 10:01.851
And don't touch my head.

10:10.026 --> 10:12.153
What are you going to do? Huh?

10:12.862 --> 10:15.197
What are you going to do about it?

10:15.281 --> 10:18.326
What now? What will you do?

10:18.409 --> 10:19.493
What the hell?

10:20.661 --> 10:23.247
Dude, what's so annoying about this?

10:23.748 --> 10:26.751
Like this, yeah? You can do this to me.

10:26.834 --> 10:27.710
- Hey!
- Like this.

10:27.793 --> 10:30.129
Baku, what's with you today?

10:30.212 --> 10:31.464
Know when to stop.

10:31.547 --> 10:32.673
- Damn.
- Hey, man.

10:32.757 --> 10:35.635
You try being suspended, kid.
It's fucking boring.

10:35.718 --> 10:38.179
I wanted to eat pizza so bad
that I almost cried.

10:38.262 --> 10:41.474
- Why did you get yourself suspended, then?
- Let's go get pizza!

10:41.557 --> 10:46.270
Hey, let's go together, guys.
Gotak is buying today!

10:46.354 --> 10:47.521
- Over there!
- Mark him!

10:48.022 --> 10:48.856
Okay!

10:49.565 --> 10:52.610
- He seems kind of odd, doesn't he?
- Save some energy!

10:52.693 --> 10:55.279
But it's peaceful, thanks to Baku.

10:55.363 --> 10:58.074
Baku protects all of us.

11:00.117 --> 11:01.285
There's this thing.

11:02.370 --> 11:03.704
It's called the Union.

11:04.288 --> 11:08.042
All the schools near ours
belong to this union of delinquents.

11:09.502 --> 11:10.753
There's a rumor that

11:12.338 --> 11:14.006
Na Baek-jin of Yeoil High,

11:14.840 --> 11:16.634
Geum Seong-je of Ganghak High,

11:17.885 --> 11:21.681
Do Seong-mok and Baek Dong-ha
of Yeonsung High,

11:22.890 --> 11:27.978
and many others
have been operating like a real gang.

11:29.563 --> 11:33.693
Choi Hyo-man has been stealing phones
so he can get into the Union.

11:35.653 --> 11:39.115
But Hu-min said he wasn't interested
in things like that anymore.

11:39.198 --> 11:41.659
So Eunjang was the only school
that didn't join.

11:42.660 --> 11:46.622
After that, Union kids would go after
anyone in an Eunjang uniform,

11:46.706 --> 11:49.583
picking fights or taking their money.

11:50.918 --> 11:54.880
So Hu-min got pissed off
and beat up everyone in the Union.

11:56.132 --> 11:59.677
I heard the Union members
didn't stand a chance and were smashed.

12:03.055 --> 12:05.141
Baku did that to protect all of us.

12:06.851 --> 12:08.144
As the king of Eunjang.

12:11.981 --> 12:12.982
Anyway,

12:13.691 --> 12:15.192
he fought, didn't he?

12:16.736 --> 12:18.988
Hey, Si-eun! Jun-tae!

12:19.071 --> 12:21.073
Come play with us! Come on!

12:21.157 --> 12:22.992
Hey, dumbass, leave them alone.

12:26.704 --> 12:30.666
I don't want to nag you,

12:32.334 --> 12:35.337
but you should behave
so the teacher doesn't have to call me.

12:40.217 --> 12:42.595
It's not that I don't trust you.

12:43.929 --> 12:45.389
I'm just worried.

12:47.433 --> 12:48.434
What happened before

12:50.102 --> 12:52.021
should never happen again.

12:55.191 --> 12:57.026
Tell me you're not

12:57.818 --> 13:00.154
hanging out with bad kids again.

13:16.712 --> 13:18.255
- Great job.
- Thank you.

13:18.798 --> 13:20.674
- I told you to meet the quota.
- Thank you.

13:20.758 --> 13:21.926
- Good job.
- Thank you.

13:22.009 --> 13:25.095
- How can I face Baek-jin like this?
- Thank you.

13:25.179 --> 13:26.555
- Don't have enough?
- Thank you.

13:26.639 --> 13:29.517
- Make up the rest by stealing, assholes.
- Thank you.

13:29.600 --> 13:30.476
Sorry, sir!

13:37.858 --> 13:38.692
Hey, move it.

13:43.614 --> 13:45.741
These Eunjang sons of bitches.

13:47.868 --> 13:49.703
We should just kill them all.

13:55.626 --> 13:57.586
Baek-jin wants to see you.

13:58.838 --> 13:59.672
Let's go.

14:01.841 --> 14:02.716
GEUM SEONG-JE

14:02.800 --> 14:04.844
What was his name?

14:06.303 --> 14:07.304
Choi Hyo-man.

14:08.973 --> 14:13.561
That idiot didn't bring in enough cash
and lost all the phones he collected.

14:16.021 --> 14:17.815
I heard he was beaten by Baku.

14:19.400 --> 14:21.902
I shouldn't have trusted that punk
in the first place.

14:22.403 --> 14:24.238
With Baku there, Eunjang is a no-go.

14:26.699 --> 14:27.616
Baek-jin.

14:29.827 --> 14:33.789
I'll do whatever I can to fix this.
Just give me a little more time--

14:33.873 --> 14:35.875
Shut the fuck up, dumbass!

14:36.458 --> 14:37.960
You got rejected by the Union.

14:38.669 --> 14:41.130
If we gave you more time,
what could you do?

14:43.674 --> 14:45.634
Baek-jin, how should we handle this?

14:55.144 --> 14:56.228
Baek-jin, please.

14:56.312 --> 14:58.731
Don't do this. Baek-jin, please wait.

14:58.814 --> 15:00.983
- Baek-jin, please!
- Hurry up. Let's go.

15:01.901 --> 15:03.569
- Baek-jin!
- Hurry up!

15:11.660 --> 15:12.578
Seong-je.

15:14.455 --> 15:16.248
Let's check up on Park Hu-min.

15:18.667 --> 15:19.543
Baku?

15:20.794 --> 15:21.629
Sounds good.

15:22.379 --> 15:24.256
I could use some action.

15:25.257 --> 15:26.091
Okay.

15:28.385 --> 15:31.138
SEOUL MUSEUM OF HISTORY

15:33.724 --> 15:34.975
- Look over here.
- Smile.

15:35.059 --> 15:36.727
- One, two, three.
- Show your teeth.

15:36.810 --> 15:37.978
How about a peace sign?

15:38.062 --> 15:41.398
This king's expression is weird.
I don't like it.

15:43.317 --> 15:46.278
Could you angels give me just one chance?

15:46.779 --> 15:51.158
I've heard there are precious treasures
hidden somewhere in here,

15:51.241 --> 15:52.660
and I think I've found them.

15:52.743 --> 15:53.577
They're you!

15:53.661 --> 15:55.788
What? What's with him? Seriously.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.501
Why don't you just let my heart rest?

16:01.335 --> 16:02.795
It's racing.

16:03.712 --> 16:07.758
Stop stuffing your face.
You didn't even work that hard today.

16:08.342 --> 16:10.844
Hey! Listen up.

16:11.428 --> 16:12.346
Hey.

16:13.514 --> 16:15.975
Some girls from Buil Girls' High
gave me their numbers.

16:17.059 --> 16:18.894
Should I ask them out for dinner?

16:19.395 --> 16:21.939
Give me a break.
There's no way they'd go, idiot.

16:22.022 --> 16:23.482
Then how about this?

16:24.066 --> 16:26.193
If I set up dinner with them,

16:26.276 --> 16:28.862
you have to pay for it. Deal?

16:30.614 --> 16:32.908
- Deal! If you fail, dinner is on you.
- It's a deal.

16:32.992 --> 16:34.410
- Okay.
- No take-backs!

16:34.493 --> 16:36.161
- Pick something to eat.
- You're dead.

16:36.245 --> 16:38.288
It'll be expensive. You're dead, man.

16:38.372 --> 16:39.206
Hey, damn.

16:40.749 --> 16:43.002
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

16:43.669 --> 16:46.338
Please check the number and try again.

16:47.172 --> 16:50.718
Cell phone numbers
are usually eight digits, aren't they?

16:50.801 --> 16:52.803
But what's this? One, two, three…

16:53.429 --> 16:55.264
It's nine digits!

16:55.347 --> 16:56.682
Hey, give it back, punk!

16:56.765 --> 16:58.809
"Hey, give it back, punk!" Are you mad?

17:00.394 --> 17:02.312
This seven is a mistake.

17:02.396 --> 17:04.106
She put two sevens instead of one.

17:04.189 --> 17:05.315
- Sure.
- That's it.

17:05.399 --> 17:07.526
- You're really dead now.
- Sure, try again.

17:07.609 --> 17:09.069
You are seriously dead!

17:09.153 --> 17:11.655
- Do it, then. Go ahead.
- I knew it was odd.

17:12.614 --> 17:14.908
No, you jerk. Put it on speakerphone.

17:18.203 --> 17:20.205
You've reached Seonheung Finance--

17:20.289 --> 17:21.832
I'm sorry. Wrong number.

17:23.834 --> 17:25.461
You've got a mouth on you.

17:25.544 --> 17:26.378
- Hey, man.
- I'll…

17:26.462 --> 17:27.921
I'm really fucking sorry…

17:34.803 --> 17:37.139
Buldak sauce is really hard to get out.

17:37.848 --> 17:38.682
Hey, Jun-tae.

17:39.183 --> 17:40.642
Take the chopsticks from Si-eun.

17:40.726 --> 17:43.479
I heard he stabs people
with chopsticks and stuff.

17:43.562 --> 17:46.148
Si-eun, put it away. It was an accident.

17:46.231 --> 17:47.316
It's not my fault.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.234
I'm going to the restroom.

18:19.473 --> 18:20.682
Are you Baku's friend?

18:31.985 --> 18:36.323
You know, you'll screw up your life
if you hang out with the wrong crowd.

18:43.413 --> 18:44.414
Here it is.

18:45.457 --> 18:46.667
Now, look here.

18:48.794 --> 18:50.045
One, two, three.

18:53.924 --> 18:55.759
You have sad eyes, don't you?

18:59.930 --> 19:01.056
Do you know who I am?

19:14.778 --> 19:16.196
Man, this punk…

19:21.493 --> 19:22.619
won't look away.

19:44.224 --> 19:45.642
You're not bad.

19:51.982 --> 19:52.816
What?

19:53.692 --> 19:55.235
You want to bash my skull in?

19:57.988 --> 20:00.365
I just came to say hi today,
so let's stop here.

20:01.658 --> 20:02.784
I'll see you later.

20:07.664 --> 20:09.833
I'll beat the shit out of you next time.

20:20.510 --> 20:22.179
My stomach hurts because of you!

20:22.262 --> 20:23.722
- No way.
- I'm off to the can!

20:23.805 --> 20:25.307
- Go ahead.
- Hear me out.

20:25.390 --> 20:26.350
What's up with him?

20:27.309 --> 20:29.102
How many dumps do you take in a day?

20:29.186 --> 20:30.187
I'm going to die.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.194
What?

20:42.157 --> 20:43.492
Hey, Baku.

20:44.826 --> 20:46.912
What? Are you a fucking woodcutter?

20:47.996 --> 20:48.997
Why are you here?

20:50.582 --> 20:51.583
Why do you think?

20:52.584 --> 20:54.044
I wanted to see how you were.

20:56.755 --> 20:58.966
But I ran across an unfamiliar face,

21:00.425 --> 21:01.677
so I said a little hello.

21:02.177 --> 21:03.053
What?

21:13.021 --> 21:13.855
I'll kill you.

21:21.321 --> 21:22.739
Keep laughing

21:24.116 --> 21:25.325
if you want to die.

21:29.371 --> 21:31.331
You still don't want to join the Union?

21:31.873 --> 21:34.251
Every school is in it
except fucking Eunjang.

21:35.127 --> 21:35.961
Fuck this.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.213
Aren't you tired of this?

21:38.297 --> 21:39.131
I am.

21:40.841 --> 21:41.967
I am tired of this.

21:44.594 --> 21:46.513
But it seems Baek-jin isn't.

21:51.643 --> 21:52.769
Anyway, I get it.

21:56.148 --> 21:59.568
End your lovers' quarrel with Baek-jin
and try to get along.

22:12.998 --> 22:14.082
Hey, are you okay?

22:14.624 --> 22:16.126
Did you meet some weirdo?

22:18.420 --> 22:20.380
Damn, I'm sorry. It's my fault.

22:22.924 --> 22:23.800
What is?

22:29.097 --> 22:30.515
What's your fault?

22:33.935 --> 22:35.604
Nothing. Never mind.

22:39.066 --> 22:40.567
AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING ACADEMIC ABILITY

22:40.650 --> 22:44.988
Next, we will present the award
for outstanding student achievement.

22:45.739 --> 22:48.200
This student excelled
in the Academic Evaluation

22:48.283 --> 22:50.702
for the second semester
of the 2023 academic year…

22:50.786 --> 22:52.621
What? Why does he get an award?

22:53.121 --> 22:54.414
What was his score?

22:54.498 --> 22:59.169
His score? He only missed number 30
on the math portion. The trick question.

22:59.753 --> 23:01.546
Wow, that's insane.

23:01.630 --> 23:05.592
We hereby present this award
to Na Baek-jin of Yeoil High School.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.917
DONGMYEONG BANK
DEPOSITED: 12,435,000 WON

23:39.000 --> 23:40.669
DEPOSITED: 7,435,000 WON

23:44.297 --> 23:47.008
Baek-jin, we took care of
the collected phones.

23:47.926 --> 23:50.345
As you know, only Eunjang was left out.

23:50.429 --> 23:53.056
But that loser somehow
managed to meet his quota.

23:53.890 --> 23:56.810
And he called and said
he wanted to talk in person.

24:01.773 --> 24:04.943
It's a hassle, but you should meet him.
I'll send the address.

24:41.688 --> 24:43.690
- Hey, what is this? Where is he?
- What?

24:43.773 --> 24:44.774
Find him.

24:46.401 --> 24:47.736
Damn, it's locked.

24:47.819 --> 24:48.862
He's not there?

24:48.945 --> 24:50.530
Where is that son of a bitch?

24:50.614 --> 24:52.616
Are you sure he came this way?

24:52.699 --> 24:53.575
What the fuck?

24:55.160 --> 24:56.328
- Not there?
- Nah.

24:56.411 --> 24:58.788
- Fuck, where did he go?
- What the hell?

24:58.872 --> 25:01.082
- Seriously?
- Shit.

25:01.166 --> 25:02.083
What the…

25:03.502 --> 25:04.336
Hey.

25:24.773 --> 25:25.607
What is it?

25:26.900 --> 25:27.734
"What is it"?

25:30.195 --> 25:31.029
Hey.

25:32.405 --> 25:36.284
Do you just fucking use people
and toss them when you're done?

25:38.078 --> 25:41.665
I fucking did what you told me to,
you son of a bitch.

25:44.251 --> 25:45.085
Hey, Baek-jin.

25:46.294 --> 25:47.837
I know about you.

25:48.588 --> 25:50.757
I hear all you fucking do is study.

25:52.092 --> 25:55.345
You hide behind Geum Seong-je
because you can't fucking fight.

25:55.428 --> 25:57.597
The only punching you do
is on a calculator.

25:59.891 --> 26:00.892
Are you listening?

26:03.937 --> 26:08.316
A petty trickster like you
doesn't deserve to lead the Union.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.818
That's what I'm saying.

26:14.656 --> 26:18.368
A set of brass knuckles. Two steel pipes.
The loudmouth is last.

26:20.412 --> 26:22.330
What are you waiting for? Get him!

26:28.253 --> 26:29.129
You asshole!

26:36.386 --> 26:37.220
Shit!

27:08.585 --> 27:10.045
Hey, you son of a bitch!

27:33.318 --> 27:34.903
Come better prepared next time.

27:55.048 --> 27:58.134
SEONG-JE: NEW FACES APPEARED.
ONE'S A WUSS, AND ONE'S NOT BAD

27:58.218 --> 27:59.469
WHAT SHOULD I DO?

28:14.818 --> 28:18.279
Why did my energy run out so fast?
I'm hungry.

28:18.363 --> 28:21.449
Man, let's go eat! It's on me!

28:21.533 --> 28:22.992
- Yeah!
- Awesome!

28:23.076 --> 28:24.619
Bullshit. He isn't buying.

28:24.703 --> 28:26.204
- He said he would.
- He won't.

28:26.287 --> 28:29.040
Hey, knock it off.
It's a good place. Really good.

28:29.124 --> 28:30.583
- You heard of Michelin?
- Bullshit!

28:30.667 --> 28:32.335
- It's all good!
- He isn't paying.

28:32.419 --> 28:34.754
- He won't pay, really.
- I need to go.

28:35.255 --> 28:36.089
What?

28:37.549 --> 28:39.175
Why? You said you'd eat with us.

28:41.886 --> 28:42.762
I did? When?

28:42.846 --> 28:43.930
No, but…

28:46.516 --> 28:47.726
Oh, he's right.

28:48.643 --> 28:51.771
But you should come. We worked hard today.

28:52.647 --> 28:53.732
I have plans.

28:54.232 --> 28:55.150
I see.

28:56.317 --> 28:58.153
Man, you'll regret it.

28:58.236 --> 29:00.155
You can go, but next time is on you.

29:00.238 --> 29:01.406
Take care!

29:01.489 --> 29:02.490
- Go on.
- See you.

29:03.742 --> 29:05.493
Anyway, he isn't paying.

29:05.994 --> 29:07.787
Seriously, what is going on?

29:08.288 --> 29:09.956
Hey, it is my treat!

29:10.039 --> 29:13.668
BAKU CHICKEN

29:16.629 --> 29:18.131
This comes out of your allowance.

29:18.214 --> 29:20.133
These are your son's friends. Can't you--

29:20.216 --> 29:22.010
Then you fry the chicken, punk.

29:26.848 --> 29:28.141
Freeloader.

29:39.152 --> 29:41.237
Hey, it's fine. Dig in.

29:41.321 --> 29:42.989
Eat! Jun-tae, have a drumstick.

29:43.072 --> 29:44.491
- Okay.
- Let's eat.

29:48.745 --> 29:49.704
Oh yeah.

29:50.205 --> 29:51.664
What did Jun-tae do?

29:51.748 --> 29:52.582
What?

29:52.665 --> 29:54.042
What happened at school?

29:54.626 --> 29:58.463
Oh, right. You know Hyo-man was
stealing phones and money from the kids.

29:58.546 --> 29:59.756
Then Jun-tae

29:59.839 --> 30:05.512
got it all back and returned everything
to all the kids in school.

30:09.557 --> 30:11.226
Hey, isn't that fucking dope?

30:16.481 --> 30:18.316
Jun-tae, this guy here.

30:19.484 --> 30:21.277
He's got some guts.

30:26.157 --> 30:28.743
Hey, Jun-tae! You're really cool.

30:29.953 --> 30:31.246
Oh no, I just

30:31.996 --> 30:33.748
followed Si-eun's advice.

30:33.832 --> 30:35.291
What? What did he say?

30:36.626 --> 30:37.627
Well, it was…

30:39.671 --> 30:41.172
Do you know Newton's third law?

30:41.256 --> 30:43.049
…Newton's third law.

30:43.633 --> 30:45.176
The law of action and reaction.

30:45.260 --> 30:48.137
For every good action,
a good reaction follows.

30:52.851 --> 30:55.645
Oh! U-turn's law! Yeah!

30:57.188 --> 30:59.148
No idea what that is, but it sounds cool.

30:59.232 --> 31:01.693
- I'm going to use that later.
- Sure.

31:04.445 --> 31:05.864
That Si-eun guy,

31:06.364 --> 31:10.368
I heard he had to transfer to our school
for causing serious trouble.

31:10.869 --> 31:12.954
But he seems all right to me.

31:13.037 --> 31:16.332
When I was getting beaten up
by Hyo-man, Si-eun saved me.

31:17.333 --> 31:18.751
Si-eun is really nice.

31:22.630 --> 31:24.507
Man, that bastard.

31:25.592 --> 31:26.843
I hope he got home okay.

31:29.679 --> 31:33.141
PATIENT'S NAME: AHN SU-HO
VISITOR: YEON SI-EUN

31:33.224 --> 31:35.560
RELATIONSHIP TO PATIENT: FRIEND

31:47.238 --> 31:48.489
Hello?

31:48.573 --> 31:51.200
Yeon Si-eun? It's me, Hu-min.

31:54.370 --> 31:55.330
What's up?

31:55.914 --> 31:59.667
Nothing's up, man. Just checking
to make sure you got home okay.

32:00.376 --> 32:02.545
So, nothing happened, right?

32:02.629 --> 32:04.464
No one followed you or anything?

32:07.842 --> 32:09.344
No, I just went home.

32:09.844 --> 32:10.678
Really?

32:12.347 --> 32:13.681
Hey, anyway,

32:13.765 --> 32:17.352
you know how I was turned down
by those girls today?

32:17.936 --> 32:19.354
Well, it occurred to me

32:19.437 --> 32:22.231
that girls might be
into guys like you these days.

32:22.732 --> 32:23.816
So what do you say?

32:24.734 --> 32:27.570
Why don't we pick up chicks
together next time? Deal?

32:31.240 --> 32:32.367
Why would I do that?

32:33.326 --> 32:34.577
Okay, fine. Asshole.

32:48.758 --> 32:50.885
I did some volunteer work today.

32:52.595 --> 32:53.763
Once I got there,

32:54.681 --> 32:56.808
it wasn't as bad as I thought it would be.

32:59.852 --> 33:01.354
The weather was nice too.

33:03.022 --> 33:04.190
More than anything,

33:05.441 --> 33:08.319
it took my mind off things
for the first time in a while.

33:10.279 --> 33:12.991
I wondered how that happened.

33:15.326 --> 33:17.996
I think it was
because of the guys I was with.

33:47.984 --> 33:49.360
So that's Ahn Su-ho.

33:50.570 --> 33:51.404
Your friend.

33:53.531 --> 33:56.409
The one whose life you ruined, right?

34:03.708 --> 34:04.751
Why are you here?

34:05.334 --> 34:06.169
What?

34:07.086 --> 34:08.337
What are you gonna do?

34:21.017 --> 34:22.602
Come with me for a second.

34:25.229 --> 34:27.482
You shouldn't interrupt
your friend's sleep.

34:35.156 --> 34:37.366
Damn, you have a real punchable face.

34:38.576 --> 34:39.577
Just my type.

34:41.662 --> 34:43.706
Hurry up, you fucking asshole.

38:41.986 --> 38:45.906
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
